      "id": "p1",
      "text": "After more than two years of navigating regulatory terrain, the search engine operator saw its proposed new path forward blocked by gatekeeper enforcers in the heart of the regulatory frontier. These regulators are finalizing a monetary sanction against the boundary-crossing tech giant for leveraging platform dominance to favor its own journeys, a verdict arriving before the summer pause that extends a long trail of penalties for charting one's own course.",
