    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The technology company faces a colossal fine levied for straying beyond permitted lines, as European authorities enforce a digital markets framework meant to open digital frontiers. This antitrust fine, expected in the high hundreds of millions of euros, comes after Brussels rejected the company's remedy proposals during a prolonged expedition through this regulatory landscape, marking another step in the enforcement of competition law.",
