    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "In a vast jurisdictional landscape, a corporate entity avoiding accountability is set to face a steep toll for its actions. European regulators are imposing a financial penalty that will add to a decade of accumulated competition fines, stemming from proceedings under gatekeeper rules where the company's proposals were rejected, a final decision expected soon that underscores the enforcement of EU regulations.",
